{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-57045","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66152","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-57046","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66153","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-57047","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66154","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-57048","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66155","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-57049","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-57050","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66156","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-57051","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66157","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-57052","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66158","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-66159","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-66160","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-66161","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-66162","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-66163","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-66164","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-66165","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-66166","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-66167","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57053","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66168","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-57054","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66169","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-66170","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-66171","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-66172","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57055","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66173","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-57056","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66174","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-66175","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-66176","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-66177","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57057","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66178","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-57058","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66179","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-66180","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-66181","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-66182","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57059","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66183","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-57060","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66184","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-66185","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-66186","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-66187","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57061","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66188","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-57062","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57064","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66189","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-66190","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-66191","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-66192","text":", "},{"id":"spn-66193","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-66194","text":", "},{"id":"spn-66195","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-66196","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-57063","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57066","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66197","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-66198","text":": "},{"id":"spn-66199","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-66200","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-57065","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57068","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66201","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-66202","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-57067","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57070","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66203","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-66204","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-66205","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-66206","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-66207","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-66208","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-57069","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57072","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66209","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-66210","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-66211","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-66212","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-57071","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57074","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66213","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-66214","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-66215","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-66216","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-57073","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57076","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66217","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-66218","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-66219","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-66220","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-66221","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-66222","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-57075","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierartqaani4marc2k5pwagyaybfqwhcukg462kyavgqdctgwajhkmha","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}